message:
Vercel itself answered 5xx for the backend — a crash, a timeout, a cold start that never came up. These never pass through the app's own logger, so the error-spike monitor (source:python) cannot see them; this is the only signal. One in thirty days on record (a 503 from the platform).

Open the Vercel deployment's runtime logs for the request ids in the alert, then `GET https://api.equipbible.com/health`.

